{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们要从西拉穿过旷野，来到少女锡安的山，",{"text":"把羊羔献给那里的掌权者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亚嫩河渡口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"如同被赶离巢穴的飞鸟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们对犹大人说：“给我们出个主意，下个决定吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"请让你们的影子在正午如黑夜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掩藏逃难的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要出卖逃亡者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让逃难的摩押人住在你们中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"请掩护他们躲避毁灭者。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺压者必逝去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭之事必终止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"入侵者必从地上消亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，必有一个宝座在爱中坚立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大卫家的人必坐在上面以信实治国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉公审判，敏行公义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我们听说摩押人骄横傲慢、狂妄自大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而他们所夸耀的都是虚假的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们必为摩押哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都必哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为失去吉珥·哈列设的美味葡萄饼而哀叹、悲伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"因为希实本的农田荒废，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西比玛的葡萄树枯萎。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各国的君王都来践踏这些上好的葡萄树。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们的枝子曾经伸展到雅谢和旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嫩枝一直蔓延到死海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我像雅谢人一样为西比玛的葡萄树哀哭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希实本和以利亚利啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用眼泪来浇灌你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为再无人为你们的果品和庄稼而欢呼了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥美的田园里听不到快乐的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄园里也无人歌唱，无人欢呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"榨酒池里无人榨酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已经使欢呼声止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的内心为摩押，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为吉珥·哈列设哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像凄凉的琴声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人上丘坛祭拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却累得筋疲力尽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在庙宇里祷告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却毫无用处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以上是耶和华所说有关摩押的预言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["现在，耶和华说：“正如一个雇工的工作年限是三年，三年之内，摩押的荣耀必和它的众民一同消失，残存的人必寥寥无几、软弱无力。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“摩押人”希伯来文是“摩押的女子”。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}